{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d9894c66ff5291dda864990ce69d96eef372922c72cf6e50c30fa787bc7bf7c5",
      "text": "Ah, Love. Did you look at the rough\ndesign for Bulleta's swimsuit\nedition?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e6745997199162ee786220c85010728be8f59d825544d5bce506712b3dcb9037",
      "text": "...The swimsuit is too daring? Not\nat all. It's exactly as ordered.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:effda977142db76655c97abee79014803fd7df5f066b9f866c7950e4a2799f64",
      "text": "A lively color named freedom. A hero\nwho shoots through the sky, yet also\na girl set free from heroism.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39265f3cf77a263a5af594b2d51b02e4ec2448e159784a6f9fbdbb32b6702029",
      "text": "That shape is the very form of your\ncool and adorable partner, packed\nwith your desires...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e44e354fe5d5504ff4ed3b9d9636723c80fa2798a8f3e03fb02204ffd11ee990",
      "text": "Adorable. At this rate, I could\ntrim a bit more fabric...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a2062c2d590365d3bcf5559bd303fe43e4fbca41c883ff6087d69f1dac315f48",
      "text": "Lady Kasivars! Crafter of the\nheroes' bodies...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cdcd6914936041bc2e7e588dbae33476af3b9a74999c554a2e51e50095426502",
      "text": "Oh... Zantetsu, was it? Have you\ncome with a commission too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea1689a2b04d9ab2c8578e32e762abf92525d7dc259a8305eb52f790c4fe11ba",
      "text": "I beg of thee... I must, at all\ncosts, have \"THAT\" crafted by your\nhand—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d7a2bed568e1393eae70b78f8175090f4b53806add098e9fed8f589346ae3b3c",
      "text": "Ah, truly. Can you imagine it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "37": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:484ecc8cc16f020a83244308d652109d989e7101a97a12a5d6d5548b66977f62",
      "text": "The feelings of someone who wished\nfor a \"rainbow-shining swimsuit.\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "41": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7f2425054b26083529d7154b818cefd38a6d964495d4b050348b2b8883416cd5",
      "text": "Ah... Zantetsu, that swimsuit... I\nmean, that loincloth. You asked\nKasivars to make it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:614d7470a7544e136a5d99ce7d8259e031045969c9133df00a522faf89a34982",
      "text": "With a huge fee and a bow to the\nfloor. I made it out of pity.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:75aded56b74252de6ce06aa606a29f65c25c646eb0f30894abb55f65f62482db",
      "text": "A pity gaming loincloth, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:308c2d6e839e6a14afc60ee73602f5ec32fa8a9834cc14a0959e364bd791e7ba",
      "text": "Kasivars, did you not want to make\nit?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97a7c0e7717ea84ae140e3698970f42fc3035d9ffc3c595fe11561d8c71e4912",
      "text": "No? It was more fun than I\nexpected.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:40269546307ee6d07a8cadfaa3dc2225d09bad0f05b2c7b250b5c3bbae2f32b2",
      "text": "Craving a hero, yet wanting rainbow\nclothes. The contradiction and folly\nonly add to it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5d7f5a6ea2ef69c7eede19422c3b2084976589a5fa426f1c69f8a9261a1c06a8",
      "text": "Haha... Well, I bet he's happy with\nit...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:01dafc6e3873308f8105a72bddde8d44c9c7af8f7b8d33b954da837d11d45bff",
      "text": "...I should have made some for you\nas well. The world would have been\nturned upside down at once.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2337dff0b2b196cd34f59c3b973d826db0274e2cabb193c24c732410cd7049a4",
      "text": "Please, no thank you...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:60e423b81ee2fd3a384c72344c6aa37da753154efa31d9394b7363622b84a8ba",
      "text": "A joke. You're going on vacation\ntoo, aren't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c4d62656ae58663987291d876a51ba66653e5e7b6a6f0b1915179c232f00f376",
      "text": "Tell me when you return. How much\nthat garment broke the world's\ncages.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a040c8b336aa6b8d97aa12c60ac2df65aa411f3d37d1b992b2b50343f92d3a50",
      "text": "I'll do my best. We'll be off...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f5622a1b37828016829e0496a0e37a0cbb58da48ea58e5e3eb82f3a333177711",
      "text": "The thing buried in that man's\ncage... A void in the dark, or\nperhaps...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:07d42f30ebb8f4baa978edb5ec0d474a2eb0882c7c2b1ea2a6a3931fb8048931",
      "text": "You are... Ah. That Defaulter from\nbefore.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f8a772ab0948dca54c928614397a53f263c2be6a4ec7f20dbb7717517a36ff6d",
      "text": "Here for maintenance on your new\nbody? Then this way—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:946d91bc95d672d972b243a16ba676408ae83996341a8f22a91a18636e82e1d5",
      "text": "N-no. Today I came to ask for\nadvice.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7e2ea9bdf56952c3768b8f48979a0e535a3203b17da0f6b6575999d7703e2c8b",
      "text": "If I said... I wanted to go back to\nmy old body, would you change me\nback?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ecc393fd5d315be892155c3cf2de04535a7753eb2d1f965a0639cce2be5b9519",
      "text": "...Go back?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57ef677435c8cd6a13915776037c8d102224e9c00896f081b21b79c2be586ac7",
      "text": "S-sorry! It's just that, after I\nreally changed my body, it felt\nsomehow wrong...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:44d1e1051e25ba18460c458ecf3df0c4f68ac0a399f44714d1fe89465b7026a8",
      "text": "The two who changed with me keep\ntaking risks with the Updaters. Maybe\nI never truly wanted to change—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7add37750643314757e8ce6f99efb4f1f4d54413b8a85d4cfd632bb6855429f9",
      "text": "Ah, so. You still hadn't noticed?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f3b34f662ca98d5f2efc12e8d26e4410026bb8b42c073d012122cad601f50f5f",
      "text": "The reason you wished to change. I\nassumed you were merely going along\nwith them.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67c275bc36115158e2c77b0f17718a141f83927781aeb195dc0340386d6e4b00",
      "text": "Um... What do you mean by that?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:920a2a2871668c26571c8f07369f84b0ae5ee1393c4f2ac87d8aeea4517008c0",
      "text": "On the day we first met. You were\nhiding behind your two spirited\nfriends.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f0e53e0c5a94cf11ca9b1199767114e4eb93451f31503cfc487e3e1703b246a9",
      "text": "Frightened, awed. Yet you could\nstand there because you were by\ntheir side.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7a48f9f84ae572367ca158d76f5e8e9c24692b770535d723f09f71a7369bffe9",
      "text": "And your face as you did so was\nquite adorable.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:587d143f3c799cf9df1aab9edca7d47e1bec9af4e78de400ad9defacb8990862",
      "text": "You don't care about your own form,\ndo you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f6f7a842a2819ae0fd95909466c147fca47c6a17bd82986c0ae004fc3678a884",
      "text": "If being with your friends is the\nform you truly crave.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:608e39962868036de0b0fce7e5da1d82168214f78c39c024b83b329fecdd1262",
      "text": "...W-well, that's...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:180f4228d026d10e82e954cb3f0667eda7aa34f63d753100f1361ee2c3c41566",
      "text": "Come to think of it... we barely hang\nout lately. They seem to be having so\nmuch fun with the Updaters...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a52b5a2462c0c5fa7ae75e1c1e995107997fa90c16233e752e493eb11d9b7cea",
      "text": "That kind of consultation is not my\njob.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86d36263c1c0a9e03f4ba42477983d93b0d1bfc7a9fc625b9c4068bec63f97ef",
      "text": "Y-yeah, of course. Sorry...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:884c8bfc7f5503f1506b96565e65be5e37321ae8a326828c4145c440e3e29c2b",
      "text": "...But is it really okay? Changing\nmy body for a reason like that...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4f713052656fc3681b074b99eead8c9f2ba7dad361813e573edec6fd8f3944e6",
      "text": "Who knows. Society's criticism is\ntrivial to me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ba18456d92606871c89b6be4d850c5a9820e59086e955531a79950245a208eac",
      "text": "But if you still want to go back,\nor want to change, rest assured.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b949a527eda687ea34df0eb5d240efcaeffa1cbae65f578a62815b9e718444bd",
      "text": "Again and again, as often as you\nlike. I'll remake you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e38ed8ab9f1b5bc16511b40cc335f5fb8571018f61d6371336ecbe6437ebd4b5",
      "text": "I-I'll try staying as I am for\nnow...! Well, bye...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0647ff121d4a0959bd755f994e85ea7391b61ba0151a0aad28e2bec24fbdc87e",
      "text": "Entrusting yourself to another... A\nform I find quite hard to\nunderstand.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4b41839db56cd6afb8158a6130eb8ea606c146959786e77f2ef1e2fc839dfe5",
      "text": "...Could it be that man, too...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4de55ea5048cd1f1c5e92df6e5c039b8b9496f6b27274fcaea705b38fddb96a3",
      "text": "Kasivars, we're back.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c30cc80a54d21dfb2331d72393758fc6f30190a6d7afcd9198af06fcc6ae9bdd",
      "text": "Ah, welcome home. Did you enjoy\nyour vacation?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21bc6f804361d81312af340edd4ded195edf915ad61480d652f9caa2552fc2ad",
      "text": "But of course! The ultimate body\nyou forged for me performed\nsplendidly, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b0390f2473ab519e48320c04e4e5fc700487f2b7e0a31ae936aa365864e708e5",
      "text": "Behold, Lady Kasivars...!\nEveryone's hero pose photographs!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86a82feb9efacee103787f3626580e3bb70dd0e672a029d9bdbeaf6f2d58334b",
      "text": "Heh... Hehehe...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83c795e366ca10bf62fba3ee3e5697b7259191d44dc48e7f38f55168b8f024f0",
      "text": "Ah, truly. Can you imagine this\nfeeling?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:54df26247486dd21fc32d46412245522b5f80e755514afb6331d86e01f8f6c9a",
      "text": "That swimsuit suited you best. I was\nsimply certain of it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b26a7b06835b6071ba3d6e97672d0cbff8ce7e7d509ac23296f4f2b6ad8dca6f",
      "text": "Hah-hah! Precisely so! As expected\nof your keen eye!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c27fb3fd859b785850ddc7c6ac449ba86d3b1414b08bbdce2ab3b560db566a71",
      "text": "A gaming loincloth is really the\nbest?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9a2dccf0587de7ef073cc2a12de566affe505b6b0890c0c788f70c1562cda85",
      "text": "Who knows? ...It was a trivial\nmatter for me, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
